WEBVTT

00:14.460 --> 00:16.350
Of course he isn't here...

00:18.660 --> 00:22.210
I wonder how Haruto is doing now.

00:22.790 --> 00:26.310
Um... what did my brother say?

00:26.310 --> 00:28.590
Um... I think it was...

00:28.590 --> 00:30.030
Mii...

00:30.030 --> 00:30.720
Eh?

00:31.550 --> 00:34.470
Mii... Haru...

00:35.150 --> 00:38.100
As if there's such coincidence.

00:38.480 --> 00:41.020
All right, time to focus...

00:59.470 --> 01:01.200
Good morning, Miharu.

01:02.430 --> 01:03.500
Morning.

01:03.850 --> 01:08.490
Practising so early again?
You really are a hard worker.

01:08.490 --> 01:09.810
You think so?

01:09.810 --> 01:11.740
You really are.

01:11.740 --> 01:15.430
Is there a reason
why you're working so hard?

01:15.430 --> 01:20.440
Huh? Well, I guess because
it's the right thing to do, but...

01:20.440 --> 01:21.460
But?

01:21.990 --> 01:25.150
While we're living in peace,

01:25.150 --> 01:28.860
Haruto is doing his best too, that's why.

01:29.950 --> 01:31.030
I see!

01:31.030 --> 01:32.610
So it's for Rio!

01:32.610 --> 01:34.410
Well, um...

01:34.410 --> 01:39.060
I don't want to be a dead weight to him.

01:40.170 --> 01:43.990
If that's the reason you're getting
better faster at spirit techniques,

01:43.990 --> 01:45.630
that's a great thing.

01:45.630 --> 01:46.880
Right.

01:46.880 --> 01:47.830
Yeah.

01:48.900 --> 01:54.390
Still, to be able to create water
in a small time span is awesome enough.

01:54.390 --> 01:56.890
You could control it too earlier, right?

01:56.890 --> 01:58.630
That's really surprising.

01:58.630 --> 02:02.190
You are connected to Lady Aishia
with a temporary path,

02:02.190 --> 02:06.140
so maybe that's why
your spirit talent is blooming.

02:06.140 --> 02:06.970
Huh?

02:08.010 --> 02:11.550
But it's also the fruits of your labour!

02:11.550 --> 02:12.570
Of course!

02:12.570 --> 02:13.390
Yes!

02:13.390 --> 02:15.770
Thanks, but...

02:16.260 --> 02:17.410
I guess so.

02:17.770 --> 02:20.830
I must thank Aishia when she's back.

02:34.780 --> 02:36.080
Aishia.

02:37.270 --> 02:39.140
Here's your tea.

02:39.730 --> 02:40.930
Okay.

02:47.110 --> 02:48.510
This is good...

02:48.510 --> 02:50.860
Just like the tea Haruto made.

02:50.860 --> 02:55.360
You think so?
Well, I was taught by him, anyway.

03:01.020 --> 03:02.950
We have wind outside.

03:07.910 --> 03:09.540
What's up, Aishia.

03:12.870 --> 03:14.020
It's nothing.

03:31.980 --> 03:34.320
SEIREI GENSOUKI - SPIRIT CHRONICLES SEASON 2

04:34.340 --> 04:36.230
D-Demons?!

04:36.230 --> 04:38.090
Why are they in a knight's uniform?!

04:39.130 --> 04:41.640
It's time for some body modification.

04:45.260 --> 04:47.690
THE LURKING DEMON HAND

04:47.690 --> 04:48.620
Who goes there?!

04:49.020 --> 04:49.920
Stop!

04:50.270 --> 04:51.990
Okay, okay.

04:51.990 --> 04:54.450
Are you adventurers from Amande?

04:54.450 --> 04:56.340
No, we're not.

04:56.340 --> 05:00.400
You're so fishy...
What were you doing in the forest?

05:00.400 --> 05:02.950
Well, we're some fishy dudes, after all.

05:02.950 --> 05:06.740
So, you must be the knights from Beltrum?

05:07.580 --> 05:09.250
How do you know that?

05:09.250 --> 05:14.060
Well, if we're talking about
the knights staying in Amande now...

05:14.060 --> 05:17.210
I suppose you're
Princess Flora's bodyguards.

05:17.710 --> 05:19.470
Who are you?!

05:19.470 --> 05:22.340
I have some business with you.

05:22.940 --> 05:27.090
There's twenty of them, eh?
They're all so young.

05:27.090 --> 05:28.590
By the way...

05:28.590 --> 05:29.270
Huh?

05:29.270 --> 05:32.140
You used to be a noble in Beltrum, right?

05:32.490 --> 05:34.220
Do you know any of them?

05:34.220 --> 05:35.780
Nah.

05:35.780 --> 05:39.150
Well, even if I do,
it won't change anything.

05:39.150 --> 05:42.620
So there won't be any problem
if we use them as subjects.

05:42.620 --> 05:43.660
I'm counting on you.

05:44.910 --> 05:48.660
What a pain!
Let's just strike and arrest them!

05:48.660 --> 05:50.930
Wait, we should talk with them first!

05:52.220 --> 05:54.490
There's a lively one here.

05:54.490 --> 05:55.750
Nice.

05:55.750 --> 05:58.670
Don't kill them all, okay?

05:58.670 --> 06:00.290
I know.

06:00.290 --> 06:03.470
I'm helping you out,
so let me have some fun.

06:03.470 --> 06:06.680
You should look out for any stragglers.

06:11.270 --> 06:15.110
Looks like he's up for it.
Let me check him out!

06:15.110 --> 06:16.290
No!

06:16.290 --> 06:17.980
Surround and hold them.

06:17.980 --> 06:20.980
If they resist, feel free to strike back...

06:21.650 --> 06:22.490
On guard!

06:22.940 --> 06:24.130
Too slow.

06:24.610 --> 06:30.490
When I have already drawn my sword,
you should enhance your bodies with magic!

06:31.970 --> 06:34.000
I found nice prey...

06:34.000 --> 06:38.420
I'll take him down
and overcome that damned duke!

06:41.460 --> 06:43.010
What an interesting fellow.

06:44.420 --> 06:47.720
Drop dead! Enchant Physical Ability!

06:52.770 --> 06:55.730
I'll save you for the last, eh!

06:58.240 --> 07:02.870
Hey, how about the rest of you
cast enhancement magic too?

07:02.870 --> 07:05.570
Enchant Physical Ability!

07:06.630 --> 07:08.350
All hands, get him!

07:08.350 --> 07:10.240
Spare the hooded man!

07:12.220 --> 07:13.750
Try me!

07:19.050 --> 07:21.370
What's wrong?
That's all you got?

07:21.370 --> 07:23.200
Amuse me!

07:23.200 --> 07:23.910
Damn it!

07:23.910 --> 07:25.620
Hey, you're missing me!

07:25.620 --> 07:28.090
How dare you look down on us!

07:29.830 --> 07:32.350
Maybe I should reduce their number.

07:33.970 --> 07:36.690
Now is my time to have fun.

07:44.420 --> 07:47.410
No way! At this rate, we'll lose!

07:47.780 --> 07:50.160
So that's a curse sword?!

07:50.160 --> 07:52.870
Man, how come people
have curse swords everywhere?!

07:52.870 --> 07:56.580
That's cheating!
If only I had one...

08:00.000 --> 08:03.140
Only seven left, huh?

08:03.140 --> 08:04.650
No way...

08:06.330 --> 08:08.220
Thanks to you,

08:08.220 --> 08:11.550
we're making progress
with collecting the fainted knights.

08:13.840 --> 08:17.810
I guess this will be one last job.

08:18.170 --> 08:21.020
You're almost up now.

08:23.370 --> 08:24.380
Run...

08:24.380 --> 08:26.700
R-Retreat!

08:28.400 --> 08:31.730
Help! We must call for help!

08:31.730 --> 08:34.330
This is a tactical retreat!

08:34.740 --> 08:39.580
So they don't know the difference
in power after fighting me?

08:39.580 --> 08:43.590
Hey, I'll still catch up to you
even if you're running away!

08:45.670 --> 08:46.740
Hey!

08:48.260 --> 08:50.140
How's he there?!

08:50.140 --> 08:53.140
Fret not.
I won't kill you.

08:59.620 --> 09:00.640
Damn!

09:04.940 --> 09:09.450
As promised, I'm saving you for last.

09:11.390 --> 09:15.270
I knew it, you have nice eyes.

09:15.270 --> 09:16.660
What?!

09:16.660 --> 09:19.960
Those muddy eyes with a hint of filth...

09:20.350 --> 09:23.310
Perhaps I might be wrong...

09:23.310 --> 09:24.420
Wait!

09:24.420 --> 09:29.130
I'll pay you money!
I won't talk about you two!

09:29.130 --> 09:31.130
Huh? Money?

09:31.130 --> 09:34.640
I got him!
I can negotiate with him for money!

09:35.820 --> 09:39.230
You really are an interesting fellow.

09:39.230 --> 09:41.060
SEIREI GENSOUKI - SPIRIT CHRONICLES SEASON 2

09:42.550 --> 09:45.560
Thank you for today.

09:45.930 --> 09:48.750
I'll send an emissary your way
in a few days.

09:48.750 --> 09:52.810
For now, I'd be happy
if you could enjoy your stay in Amande.

09:52.810 --> 09:53.650
Okay.

09:54.100 --> 09:55.330
Thank you.

09:55.770 --> 09:56.940
U-Um...

09:56.940 --> 09:58.080
Yes?

09:58.080 --> 10:03.210
Well, if we meet again somewhere,
allow me to have a chat with you.

10:03.210 --> 10:06.980
We'd like to thank you properly as well.

10:06.980 --> 10:08.340
Please.

10:08.340 --> 10:10.320
Sure, gladly.

10:10.850 --> 10:11.840
I guess...

10:12.210 --> 10:14.890
She really notices something about me?

10:14.890 --> 10:17.850
Or is it just the way she is?

10:18.470 --> 10:20.850
Anyway, I'll keep an eye out on her.

10:20.850 --> 10:24.300
Well, until we can make sure
the surroundings are safe,

10:24.300 --> 10:27.590
we're also staying in Amande.

10:27.590 --> 10:32.010
If he's coming to Liselotte's manor,
you'll have plenty of chances to meet him.

10:32.010 --> 10:35.290
Yes, it's exactly like the Hero said.

10:35.290 --> 10:38.930
Should I set up for a tea party?

10:38.930 --> 10:40.870
Master Haruto, what do you say?

10:40.870 --> 10:44.070
Of course, if you invite me.

10:44.070 --> 10:46.130
I'll gladly join you.

10:46.130 --> 10:48.660
Me too!

10:48.660 --> 10:52.100
Then, let's save that for another day.

10:52.100 --> 10:54.630
We really should let him go home already.

10:54.630 --> 10:58.420
Right. Sorry for stopping you.

10:58.420 --> 11:01.040
See you soon, Haruto.

11:01.040 --> 11:02.140
Yes.

11:02.480 --> 11:05.210
See you later, everyone.

11:05.690 --> 11:06.980
Have a great day.

11:25.260 --> 11:28.940
Um, what's wrong, Master Hiroaki?

11:28.940 --> 11:30.710
What is it?

11:30.710 --> 11:33.170
You don't seem too happy.

11:33.170 --> 11:35.930
You must be having something on your mind.

11:35.930 --> 11:39.780
Nah, nothing wrong with me.

11:40.720 --> 11:44.010
Never mind me,
isn't Flora acting weird today?

11:44.640 --> 11:45.560
Huh?

11:46.580 --> 11:49.820
Am I acting weird?

11:50.990 --> 11:53.110
So you're not aware?

11:53.110 --> 11:55.500
Ever since we got attacked by demons.

11:55.500 --> 11:59.320
Or rather, ever since he showed up,
you were always feeling restless.

11:59.320 --> 12:02.830
It's like your mind isn't there.

12:03.500 --> 12:06.000
I don't think that's the case...

12:06.000 --> 12:09.090
Well, if you say so.

12:09.090 --> 12:11.750
It's just what I see.

12:11.750 --> 12:15.090
How do I look from your perspective?

12:16.220 --> 12:19.970
You were always looking at him.

12:19.970 --> 12:22.270
Um...

12:22.270 --> 12:23.970
Are you talking about Master Haruto?

12:23.970 --> 12:27.820
So you're awake I'm talking about Haruto, huh?

12:27.820 --> 12:30.630
Huh? No, I mean...

12:30.630 --> 12:34.230
Lady Flora is our representative, after all.

12:34.570 --> 12:39.930
She must be wondering how to thank him
for saving us from a predicament.

12:40.330 --> 12:44.850
Duke Huguenot also tried
to scout him as well.

12:45.290 --> 12:47.420
Oh, I see.

12:47.420 --> 12:48.750
Is that true?

12:48.750 --> 12:50.250
Yes.

12:51.250 --> 12:54.960
Well, I get where you're coming from.

12:54.960 --> 12:56.610
But Haruto, eh...

12:56.610 --> 13:00.760
Everyone's just making
a big deal out of him.

13:00.760 --> 13:03.940
That's because you're
too awesome, Master Hiroaki.

13:03.940 --> 13:04.540
Huh?

13:04.540 --> 13:08.520
Among us normal people,
he's already something else.

13:08.520 --> 13:10.460
Oh, I get it now!

13:10.460 --> 13:14.520
So that's what it is, huh!
I guess it can't be helped, then!

13:24.570 --> 13:25.990
It's done.

13:25.990 --> 13:27.930
Well done.

13:27.930 --> 13:30.250
I'm already starting now.

13:35.420 --> 13:39.050
Demons?!
Why are they in a knight's uniform?!

13:53.100 --> 13:54.700
What's that?!

13:54.700 --> 13:57.110
It's time for some body modification.

13:57.530 --> 14:00.820
I'm remaking his soul and body.

14:06.060 --> 14:11.390
Lucius, could you remove their clothes?

14:11.390 --> 14:15.330
I'm not into undressing some dudes.
You do it yourself.

14:15.330 --> 14:16.750
Good grief.

14:16.750 --> 14:20.880
So, why did you let him
retain his consciousness?

14:20.880 --> 14:22.830
Try it on this guy.

14:22.830 --> 14:26.760
The perfect revenant.
I think he'll make a good sample.

14:26.760 --> 14:31.110
If we fail, we'll lose our precious stone.

14:31.110 --> 14:33.120
Oh, come on.

14:33.120 --> 14:36.380
You're also enhancing the others, right?

14:36.380 --> 14:40.490
In terms of strength, we'll have enough
if we combine the pawns we have.

14:41.360 --> 14:43.840
I suppose I have no choice.

14:46.480 --> 14:48.310
There we go...

14:48.310 --> 14:50.240
Let me go! Don't!

14:51.730 --> 14:52.720
Let's see...

14:59.130 --> 15:01.390
It doesn't hurt, does it?

15:01.390 --> 15:04.800
I'm not hurting your body.

15:04.800 --> 15:08.380
You're about to feel pain
in your body and soul from now.

15:08.890 --> 15:11.500
It'll take some time.

15:20.050 --> 15:23.230
The search squad hasn't returned yet?

15:24.090 --> 15:28.850
So that means there are demons beyond
our expectations lurking in the forest?

15:28.850 --> 15:32.820
Perhaps they're just lost.

15:33.300 --> 15:35.800
Okay. You're dismissed.

15:35.800 --> 15:38.130
I'll let you know
how to handle the situation later.

15:38.130 --> 15:39.670
Understood.

15:39.670 --> 15:43.670
I really could use pawns
with excellent military aspects.

15:45.620 --> 15:49.260
That squad also had Alphonse...

15:49.260 --> 15:51.680
He really is incompetent.

15:52.660 --> 15:56.080
Was I really acting strange today?

15:57.590 --> 15:59.930
What do I want to do anyway?

15:59.930 --> 16:04.410
Rio, Haruto, he has a different name,
and a different hair colour.

16:04.410 --> 16:06.200
He shouldn't be that person.

16:06.610 --> 16:09.950
But if Master Haruto really is Master Rio...

16:10.480 --> 16:12.830
Get her out of here and run!

16:13.610 --> 16:16.340
He saved me back then,

16:16.340 --> 16:20.170
but I couldn't thank him,
and clear the misunderstanding.

16:20.170 --> 16:22.670
I couldn't do anything.

16:23.760 --> 16:25.190
Should I apologise?

16:25.190 --> 16:29.650
I know I've done something terrible
that an apology won't be enough.

16:32.110 --> 16:34.140
I'm truly sorry about this.

16:34.140 --> 16:37.640
I should've sent my men as well.

16:37.640 --> 16:38.690
No.

16:38.690 --> 16:44.020
It was I who offered to form the vanguard
search party with our knights.

16:44.020 --> 16:45.460
But...

16:45.460 --> 16:48.540
It's not confirmed
that they're annihilated yet.

16:48.970 --> 16:50.470
Let's change our attitude.

16:50.470 --> 16:52.340
Thank you.

16:52.340 --> 16:56.430
I'd love to send out another party now...

16:57.330 --> 16:59.290
Then, do that at sunrise.

16:59.770 --> 17:04.770
It's still possible they might
turn up in the morning.

17:04.770 --> 17:05.920
Okay.

17:06.330 --> 17:11.970
Still, we should've cleared out most of
the demons in the battle the other day...

17:11.970 --> 17:13.180
Yes...

17:13.660 --> 17:17.660
There were some who ran into the forest.

17:18.100 --> 17:22.520
But I refuse to think
it wasn't all of them.

17:23.040 --> 17:27.230
There are still some minotaurs, then?

17:27.680 --> 17:29.190
That might be the case.

17:29.190 --> 17:31.540
If we're thinking of the worst case scenario,

17:31.540 --> 17:34.600
there might be stronger demons than those.

17:36.060 --> 17:38.580
There were so many demons back there,

17:38.580 --> 17:41.410
so it's impossible to think we missed them.

17:41.410 --> 17:46.290
But such preconceived notion
is related to the current situation.

17:47.840 --> 17:50.220
Then, I'll have Aria go there.

17:50.220 --> 17:53.190
I'll also choose among
my servants and soldiers,

17:53.190 --> 17:57.030
and give curse swords to the skilled ones.

17:57.030 --> 17:58.060
Right.

17:58.060 --> 18:01.390
I'd love to offer my knights as well...

18:01.390 --> 18:02.140
No.

18:02.810 --> 18:06.880
We can't afford to have
more of your men on the field.

18:06.880 --> 18:08.320
We'll take care of the rest.

18:09.390 --> 18:12.570
Understood.
Then, what about Haruto?

18:12.570 --> 18:16.970
I think we should ask
for his help again...

18:16.970 --> 18:22.610
Yes. If he's an Amande adventurer,
it'll be easy to ask him.

18:22.610 --> 18:25.080
But he's just a civilian.

18:25.660 --> 18:26.770
Besides...

18:27.190 --> 18:30.340
He also has someone
he seems to have to protect.

18:30.340 --> 18:32.090
You're right.

18:32.090 --> 18:36.540
At times like this,
we should ask adventurers first.

18:36.540 --> 18:40.020
Yes, but we won't be using them now.

18:40.850 --> 18:45.060
As long as there's
a possibility of minotaurs appearing,

18:45.060 --> 18:47.360
when the lightly guarded
Amande is under attack,

18:47.360 --> 18:49.670
we sure could use some force to withstand it.

18:49.670 --> 18:51.730
That's a reasonable concern.

18:57.740 --> 19:03.150
Seems like the individuals we remade last
are almost getting used to their new selves.

19:03.150 --> 19:05.670
That's great, but...

19:06.070 --> 19:10.010
There's just a lot of them!
Get them stowed somewhere!

19:10.010 --> 19:15.630
Oh, but they're my newest collection,
so I'd like to look at them some more.

19:16.670 --> 19:20.640
You always have bad taste,
but not like me, huh?

19:20.640 --> 19:24.650
Well, they're just like my children, after all.

19:27.540 --> 19:32.700
Finally, some peace.
Now I can sleep like a log.

19:32.700 --> 19:34.530
We'll execute the plan tomorrow morning.

19:34.530 --> 19:39.280
We'll be striking at sunrise,
so don't you oversleep, okay?

19:39.280 --> 19:44.040
If you're worried I might sleep too long,
then go tell our new guy instead.

19:44.040 --> 19:45.740
Right?

19:46.310 --> 19:50.390
Before the useless bunch
get used to their power,

19:50.390 --> 19:54.800
I could've done everything by myself.

19:55.630 --> 19:57.780
Wow, what a creepy voice.

19:57.780 --> 20:00.450
That's the complete revenant.

20:00.450 --> 20:04.810
He's more aggressive than the other subjects,
and his fighting ability is massively improved.

20:05.290 --> 20:08.350
He lost his reasoning abilities,
but still retains his intelligence.

20:08.350 --> 20:09.560
It's hard to handle him.

20:09.560 --> 20:12.850
But he'll be useful to us
in tomorrow's siege, right?

20:12.850 --> 20:14.820
Yes, that's right.

20:15.190 --> 20:18.200
As a disposable pawn, that is.

20:18.200 --> 20:21.120
I'm counting on you, Alphonse.

20:23.270 --> 20:24.640
Here.

20:29.080 --> 20:32.730
Kill! Must kill them!

20:32.730 --> 20:35.110
He even eats the bone?

20:35.960 --> 20:37.680
He's done for.

20:41.840 --> 20:43.600
Haruto, wake up.

20:46.250 --> 20:47.850
Aishia?

20:47.850 --> 20:49.280
Morning.

20:49.660 --> 20:51.930
Morning. It's an emergency.

20:52.370 --> 20:53.820
What happened?

20:54.450 --> 20:57.780
I can sense the presence
of demons out of the blue.

20:57.780 --> 20:58.950
Huh?

20:58.950 --> 21:01.680
Is it from inside the town?
Or the outside?

21:01.680 --> 21:03.740
I don't know the exact location.

21:04.170 --> 21:05.820
But they're out in the west.

21:05.820 --> 21:09.570
Their presence is jumbled,
so I think there's a lot of them.

21:09.570 --> 21:10.250
Huh?

21:10.690 --> 21:15.290
A presence this strong should
have been obvious to me from afar,

21:15.290 --> 21:16.750
but I couldn't sense it.

21:17.280 --> 21:19.760
There must be something wrong
since yesterday.

21:20.010 --> 21:22.390
WEST GATE

21:24.460 --> 21:26.430
Is there someone on the highway?

21:26.430 --> 21:27.600
Someone?

21:28.100 --> 21:33.520
We got a report saying the knights
in the forest might be back soon...

21:35.340 --> 21:39.900
All right.
Let's find out about the situation.

21:40.560 --> 21:41.740
What about Master?

21:41.740 --> 21:43.490
She's still asleep.

21:43.490 --> 21:44.510
I see.

21:47.790 --> 21:50.290
Are the knights back?

21:54.880 --> 21:55.820
Demons!

21:55.820 --> 21:57.590
Sound the bell!

23:40.070 --> 23:40.950
